<item>
  <title>Math rendering example</title>
  <dc:creator>Richard Mason</dc:creator>
  <link>https://richardpmason.com/posts/math-rendering-example/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>A quick check that maths renders correctly. Inline math like <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?e%5E%7Bi%5Cpi%7D%20+%201%20=%200"> works within a sentence.</p>
<p>Display equations work too:</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cint_%7B-%5Cinfty%7D%5E%7B%5Cinfty%7D%20e%5E%7B-x%5E2%7D%20%5C,%20dx%20=%20%5Csqrt%7B%5Cpi%7D%0A"></p>
<p>As does numbered equation notation with <code>\begin{equation}</code>:</p>
<p><span id="eq-maxwell-ampere"><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cnabla%20%5Ctimes%20%5Cmathbf%7BB%7D%20-%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bc%7D%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpartial%20%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D%7D%7B%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20=%20%5Cfrac%7B4%5Cpi%7D%7Bc%7D%5Cmathbf%7BJ%7D%0A%5Ctag%7B1%7D"></span></p>
<p>Referenced as Equation&nbsp;1.</p>



 ]]></description>
